#: src/pages/Settings/tabs/MachineTab.jsx
msgid "A given alpha behaves faster in time at 80 SPS because it is applied more often. Tune the two alpha values independently for your installed sample rate. Changing sample rate resets both values to 0.80 at 10 SPS or 0.40 at 80 SPS as sensible starting points."
